To handle large CSV files efficiently and to implement proper error handling, we can refactor the previous solution to include batch processing and streaming. Batch processing helps manage memory usage and database transaction overhead, while streaming allows us to read and process the file line by line, which is crucial for very large files. We will also add error handling to ensure that the system can recover gracefully from errors during file parsing and database operations.

